.TH percona-proxy 1
.SH NAME
percona-proxy - An intelligent database proxy
.SH DESCRIPTION
Percona Proxy for MariaDB is an intelligent database proxy that allows the forwarding
of database statements to one or more database servers using complex rules, a
semantic understanding of the database statements and the roles of the various
servers within the backend cluster of databases.

Percona Proxy for MariaDB is designed to provide load balancing and high availability
functionality transparently to the applications. In addition it provides
a highly scalable and flexible architecture, with plugin components to
support different protocols and routing decisions.

